  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "3354-root",
    "title": "Embracing diversity at AKU-ISMC! ",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "The celebration of \"Nowruz\" within our AKU-ISMC student engagement programme was truly special",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "b87e0aa769e65a68",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "3354-BannerImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/3354-BannerImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "Embracing diversity at AKU-ISMC!"
      },
      {
        "_uid": "c4844e2baae95e11",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "medium",
        "filename": "3354-MediumImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/3354-MediumImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "Embracing diversity at AKU-ISMC!"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "On March 20th, AKU-ISMC was alive with the festive spirit of \"Nowruz\" as we celebrated together in our student engagement scheme, showing our commitment to welcoming everyone and being united."
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Our programme brings students from different backgrounds together to share and enjoy each other's cultures. Through fun activities and events, we create a friendly space where everyone feels included and valued."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "During the Nowruz celebration, students had a great time sharing traditions and enjoying the diversity of our community. It was a happy day filled with laughter and friendship, showing how much we appreciate each other's differences."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As we reflect on this joyous occasion, let it serve as a reminder of the importance of nurturing inclusivity and respect for all cultures within our AKU-ISMC family. Together, let us continue to cultivate an environment where diversity is celebrated, and cultural unity flourishes, enriching the fabric of our shared experience. "
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
